description: Zero Touch PR size and reviewability
globs:
  - "**/*"
---

# PR shape

- Prefer PRs that prove one invariant or deliver one vertical slice.
- If a diff exceeds ~400 net lines of logic (excluding generated), split before review.
- PR description must include: intent, risk, test plan, rollback/flag.
- Do not mix refactors with behavior changes on critical-path packages.
